  m_Text: "Dear my lord,\nWhite Out Survival is finally going to officially meet you! Before you start building your town and exploring the ice fields, please accept the reward for participating in the deletion test. Of course, don’t forget to claim the first top-up bonus. \r\rDuring the file deletion test, your stored value is 1000. You can check the rewards you can get by pulling down this interface. Please confirm whether you want to use this character to activate the rewards?"
